###登录 login
POST {{host}}/api/system/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "18613030111",
  "password": "123456"
}
> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data); %}

###查询用户菜单 query_user_menu
GET {{host}}/api/system/user/queryUserMenu
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

